  "notes": "{学問|がくもん} refers to academic learning and scholarship.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- No standard transitive pair\n- Pattern: {学問|がくもん}する\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {学問|がくもん}する (to study - formal)\n- {学問|がくもん}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{励|はげ}む→励む：11822_hagemu⟧ (to devote oneself to study)\n- {学問|がくもん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{修|おさ}める→修める：27839_osameru⟧ (to acquire learning)\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {学問|がくもん}⟦{的|てき}→〜的：09839_teki⟧ (academic, scholarly)\n- {学問|がくもん}⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{自由|じゆう}→自由：01148_jiyuu⟧ (academic freedom)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {学問|がくもん}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{王道|おうどう}→王道：13505_oudou⟧⟦なし→無し：03779_nashi⟧ (No royal road to learning)\n- {学問|がくもん}⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦すすめ→勧める：02120_susumeru⟧ (Encouragement of Learning - famous book by Fukuzawa Yukichi)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{勉強|べんきょう}→勉強：00770_benkyou⟧: study (more casual)\n- ⟦{学習|がくしゅう}→学習：02623_gakushuu⟧: study, learning",
